---
// The source line under every chart. It always begins "Synthetic data."
// Anything in the slot is added after the standard sentence.
---

<p class="source">
  <strong>Synthetic data.</strong> Simulated figures calibrated to published research. <slot />
</p>

<style>
  .source {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-faint);
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
